// Survival ask-consult scenario for Worldwake.
//
// Purpose: land the roadmap's ask-about-person + consult-record row inside a
// real 1440-tick survival scenario. A witness starts at the orchard beside a
// missing subject and later returns to the hall for water and washing. An
// overdue searcher at the hall must ask that witness and acquire the orchard
// lead through hearsay memory. Separately, a claimant at the same hall faces a
// vacant support-law office whose local OfficeRegister must be consulted before
// declare_support can lawfully proceed.
//
// Lawful competing affordances intentionally constrained:
// - no tell, notice-posting, or report-backed vacancy path; consult-record is
//   the truthful office-belief unlock
// - no hall-local food production path; the search row still depends on the
//   orchard lead rather than a hall harvest shortcut
// - the missing subject is static support substrate with zero metabolism so the
//   ask branch stays about epistemic acquisition rather than subject drift
